  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "うしお",
    "text": "「お、遅くなっちゃったの……」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 63,
    "dress": "old-sp-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sp-civvies_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 16,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "うしお",
    "text": "「転校生くん、待たせちゃって悪かったの。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "うしお",
    "text": "「言い訳をするつもりはないのだけど、」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "うしお",
    "text": "「のんびり泳ぐのに慣れすぎちゃって、時間感覚が少しずれちゃってるの」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "うしお",
    "text": "「おかげで、風紀委員の瀬川さんにも、さいきんは呆れられてるの」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "うしお",
    "text": "「もともと旧校舎に入り浸っていたから、遅刻しても他の人ほどきつくは言われてなかったのだけど……」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "うしお",
    "text": "「それはそれで、見放されたみたいで少し悲しいの」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 63,
    "dress": "old-sp-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sp-civvies_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 16,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "うしお",
    "text": "「ともあれ。今日はいわゆる『デート』というやつなの」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "うしお",
    "text": "「男の人とデートするのは、はじめてだから緊張するけど、よろしく頼むの」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 63,
    "dress": "old-sp-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sp-civvies_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 16,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "うしお",
    "text": "「……え。どうしてデートすることになったのか、って？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 63,
    "dress": "old-sp-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sp-civvies_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 16,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "うしお",
    "text": "「うーん。みづきちゃん、もしかして転校生くんに説明をしなかった？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "うしお",
    "text": "「そう。特に説明を受けてない、ってことね……？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 63,
    "dress": "old-sp-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sp-civvies_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 16,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "うしお",
    "text": "「わかったの。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "うしお",
    "text": "「もともとはわたしの頼みごとだし、わたしからデートをすることになったいきさつを教えるの」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "うしお",
    "text": "「転校生くんは、見ず知らずのひとともうまく付き合えるから、あまり気にならないのかもしれないけど」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "うしお",
    "text": "「わたし、すごく人見知りしてしまうタイプなの」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "うしお",
    "text": "「それでね。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "うしお",
    "text": "「去年あった、円城寺さん主催のハロウィンパーティーでオカ研の時国さんと仲良くなったのだけど」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "うしお",
    "text": "「明日、時国さんとふたりで遊びに行くことになってるの」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 63,
    "dress": "old-sp-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sp-civvies_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 16,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "うしお",
    "text": "「だけど時国さん、あまり喋らないひとだから」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 63,
    "dress": "old-sp-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sp-civvies_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 16,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "うしお",
    "text": "「時国さんと仲のいい転校生くんに教えてもらいながら、ついでに水族館の下見をするの」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 63,
    "dress": "old-sp-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sp-civvies_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 16,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "うしお",
    "text": "「そうなの。時国さんと行くのは見ての通り、水族館なの」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 63,
    "dress": "old-sp-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sp-civvies_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 16,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "うしお",
    "text": "「水族館でお昼すぎまで過ごして、近くの映画館でホラー映画を見て帰るつもりなの」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 63,
    "dress": "old-sp-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sp-civvies_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 16,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "うしお",
    "text": "「きっと、水族館で魚を見るのは楽しいの……♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "うしお",
    "text": "「それに、映画館ならたくさん話す心配もないの」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "うしお",
    "text": "「数日間、ガイドブックを見ながら決めたから、コース選びはちゃんとできてるはずなの」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 63,
    "dress": "old-sp-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sp-civvies_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 16,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "うしお",
    "text": "「あとは実際に見てみるだけだから、その予行演習に付き合ってほしいの」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 63,
    "dress": "old-sp-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sp-civvies_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 16,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "うしお",
    "text": "「わたし、引っ込み思案なほうだから、ちゃんと練習して、安心しておきたいの」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 63,
    "dress": "old-sp-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sp-civvies_expression/angry",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 16,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "うしお",
    "text": "「今回は珍しくマジなの。本気と書いてマジと読むの」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "うしお",
    "text": "「だから、頭を下げてでも付き合ってほしいの。よろしくお願いするの！」"
  }
]